    },
    "ground_truth_entity_text": "8D: Temperature Issue Flow X/M & Flow X/P -  - 1) When the Flow X/M or Flow X/P is working on higher temperatures the processor\nwill stall.\n2) The design of the casing mechanics leads to a high internal temperature of the\ncomponents, cooling is insufficient. - The root cause of problem 1) is caused by the iMX processor revision.\nThe root cause of problem 2) is caused by the mechanical design of the casings, this\nlead to unsufficient cooling and thus a high temperature inside the casing",
